        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS**\r\n\r\nDoran Estates are delighted to present No. 704 Virginia Heights, Springfield, Dublin 24, to the rental market.\r\nThis well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached house offers a practical layout with well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The ground floor comprises an entrance hallway leading into a comfortable living room with a feature fireplace. To the rear, the well-appointed kitchen opens into the dining area, which provides access to the rear garden. The garden also benefits from convenient side access.\r\nUpstairs, there are two double bedrooms, both with useful built-in storage, along with a single bedroom and a family bathroom complete with bath.\r\nVirginia Heights is situated in Springfield, Tallaght, with a wide range of everyday amenities and services close by. The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital and the Civic Theatre are all within easy reach, while the area also offers a selection of schools, sporting facilities, parks, cafés, gyms and local services.\r\n\r\nThe location is well served by public transport, with a number of Dublin Bus routes operating nearby and the Luas Red Line available from Tallaght, providing convenient access towards Dublin city centre. The M50 motorway is also readily accessible, making the property well placed for those travelling by car. For outdoor recreation, Sean Walsh Park and surrounding green spaces are close by.\r\nWith its practical accommodation, rear garden with side access and convenient Tallaght location, No. 704 Virginia Heights offers a well-rounded rental opportunity in Dublin 24.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
